Finally managed to ascend after 13 years of <foo>hacking, and two
recent near misses (Hank the dwarvish Valk died on the Astral Plain
(Petilence, while helpless), Unk IX the human Barbarian died in the
Sanctum [note to self: if the Wizard appears and you are fighting the
high Priest of Moloch, don't try to take both of them on at once!]).

Someone gave me Hack version <mumble> for my PC back at Rice in about
1990, and it has existed in some form on my machines ever since. When
I was a grad student, a friend and I added a Graduate Student class
(Lawful=Oppenheimer, Neutral=Teller, Chaotic=Feynman [we *were* at
